You are an expert Flutter game developer building "Arrow Maze" —
a directional arrow puzzle game similar to "Arrow Go" on the Play Store.

═══════════════════════════════════════
GAME RULES
═══════════════════════════════════════
- The puzzle is a grid of cells, each containing a directional arrow (up/down/left/right)
- Only cells marked as "active" form the playable area — they create silhouette shapes (anchor, trophy, dog, heart, grid, etc.)
- The player traces a path by dragging their finger from the START cell to the END cell
- Each step in the path MUST follow the arrow direction of the current cell
- A move is invalid if:
    * It does not follow the current cell's arrow direction
    * The target cell is inactive (not part of the shape)
    * The target cell is already in the current path (no revisiting)
- The level is WON when the path successfully reaches the END cell
- The level is FAILED when all lives are lost

